<main class="page">
  <h1>About {{name}}</h1>
  <p>About {{name}}: a web app built with BRAINLLM. This page tells visitors what the project does, who it is for and why it exists. Replace these paragraphs with your own words: a clear sentence about the problem you solve, one about the people you serve and one about what makes your approach different.</p>
  <p>Search engines and assistants read this page to understand the whole site, so keep it specific. Mention the main things a visitor can do here and link to them, starting with the <a href="/">home page</a>.</p>
</main>

